      "amount": "1 tbsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh parsley",
      "amount": "1 tbsp",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion and sauté until translucent.",
    "Stir in minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 30 seconds.",
    "Add tomato paste, dried paprika, and ground cumin, stirring until fragrant.",
    "Pour in the shrimp stock and bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add dried malt extract and stir until it dissolves completely.",
    "Introduce shrimp pieces into the sauce and cook until they turn pink, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Squeeze lemon juice over the shrimp and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste and remove from heat.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley before serving."
  ],
